# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Project-Specific Research Data Policy
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# IMPORTANT:
# Do NOT globally ignore the following directories:
#
# data/
# results/
# figures/
# notebooks/
# scripts/
# docs/
# EleProtect_App/
#
# These directories contain intentional research artifacts,
# computational outputs, documentation, or application resources.
#
# Large external datasets should be excluded individually rather
# than by globally ignoring an entire scientific data format.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Model Artifact Policy
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# .joblib files are intentionally NOT ignored.
#
# The repository contains tracked model artifacts under:
#
# EleProtect_App/models/
#
# Examples:
#   eleprotect_model.joblib
#   feature_columns.joblib
#   scaler.joblib
#
# These files are part of the reproducible application workflow.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# Large External Reference Data
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# Do NOT add a blanket rule such as:
#
# *.fasta
# *.fa
# *.faa
# *.fna
#
# because this repository intentionally contains curated sequence
# files required for the research workflow.
#
# Large external datasets should instead be excluded by their
# specific filename/path when necessary.


# ------------------------------------------------------------
# End of File
# ------------------------------------------------------------
